  "briefing": "Halcyon Group holds Patagonia through its harbour yard. Download the records from the vault server, take down the site warden, unlock the service gate, then leave by the exit. Expect 12 enemy agents and 5 guards on the streets.",
  "story": "Patagonia Vault Job: Halcyon Group runs Patagonia from its harbour yard, and the district only notices when the lights go out. Your team has one night to download the records, silence the warden and walk out the exit.",
